{"about_the_game":"A microscopic world is in need of your help! Add transporters to membranes to move molecules and ions into and out of cells. Your goal is to reach specific concentrations.<br> <br>Over 20 unique puzzles will help you master the principles of cellular transport. Use channels, co-transporters, and antiporters to master facilitated diffusion and active transport.<br> <br>Think you understand how transporters diffuse molecules and ions across the membrane? Try making your own puzzles with the built in level editor!<br> <br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 20 puzzles ranging from a gentle introduction to challenging mind benders.<br></li><li>Speed up and slow down time to play at your own pace.<br></li><li>16 transporters including real proteins found in your body and imaginative nano-robots.<br></li><li>Puzzle mechanics based on real biological principles of cellular transport.<br></li><li>Built-in level editor lets you take control and make your own levels to challenge your friends!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"50301a766c17e8ec0da1c98fe86b5ff51503328a.jpg","localized_name":"Punch through","name":"Punch through","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664660/50301a766c17e8ec0da1c98fe86b5ff51503328a.jpg"},{"icon":"8a68ce9c4465195b85b87e5423757cb9a6697ee5.jpg","localized_name":"Yo, they go from high to low.","name":"Yo, they go from high to low.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664660/8a68ce9c4465195b85b87e5423757cb9a6697ee5.jpg"},{"icon":"c858f22afbe62eed63b360b4b38287b446ec3b54.jpg","localized_name":"Transporter, I said \"Stop!\"","name":"Transporter, I said \"Stop!\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664660/c858f22afbe62eed63b360b4b38287b446ec3b54.jpg"},{"icon":"4524a90f9c5dfccb64b27b6f44c1af31d7219808.jpg","localized_name":"An exclusive bunch","name":"An exclusive bunch","path":